          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>R21 Fetal anomalies with a likely genetic cause, for Baby WIGAN. QF-PCR and microarray normal. Rapid prenatal exome sequencing (North Thames GLH): heterozygous pathogenic COL1A1 variant, consistent with osteogenesis imperfecta. Referral to clinical genetics is recommended.</p></div>"
